{
  "description": "R15/U1/O1: the RELEASE app idles < 0.5 % CPU over 60 s with < 80 MB physical footprint and a < 20 MB stripped binary; on the automation build the 50-trigger hotkey latency (p99 < 200, p50 < 80) and dismiss probes pass with the real views; docs/PERFORMANCE.md records numbers that agree with this run",
  "requirement": "R15 (GPUI Phase 1), U1, O1",
  "notes": [
    "release_budget launches the release build (cargo build --release, no automation channel, TN3) as its own isolated instance (temp root, UBILINK_DATA_DIR, single-instance socket, no hotkeys), lets it settle 5 s, then measures CPU as the ps cumulative-CPU-time delta over 60 s of wall time, physical footprint with `vmmap --summary` ('Physical footprint:', Activity Monitor's Memory number), and the binary's size after `strip` (README).",
    "The latency loop and placement steps are panel-hotkey.json's, run first on a fresh automation instance before any a11y call (activating the a11y tree slows every later frame); the dismiss steps are panel-dismiss.json's. Copied here at Phase 0 because Phase 1 may change neither file.",
    "PERFORMANCE.md's table format, required rows, budgets and the tolerances for 'agrees with this run' are in README 'PERFORMANCE.md format'. The first step checks only the doc (so a missing doc fails fast); the last compares it with this run's measurements and dry-runs `make -n budget` (R15's make target).",
    "Each latency trigger and each dismiss case is a block (focus-theft retry, README Unattended guards)."
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "docs/PERFORMANCE.md records every budget row, each within budget",
      "perf_doc": "{repo}/docs/PERFORMANCE.md"
    },
    {
      "name": "release app: idle CPU < 0.5 % over 60 s, footprint < 80 MB, stripped binary < 20 MB",
      "release_budget": true,
      "idle_s": 60,
      "settle_s": 5,
      "cpu_pct_lt": 0.5,
      "footprint_mb_lt": 80,
      "binary_mb_lt": 20
    },
    {
      "name": "nothing timed yet",
      "call": "metrics",
      "expect": {
        "summary.hotkey_to_first_frame.count": 0,
        "capacity": {
          "ge": 50
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "cursor on the main display",
      "warp_cursor": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "trigger 1/50 opens",
      "block": "trigger-1",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "capture"
      },
      "expect": {
        "route": "capture",
        "shell.visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "trigger 1/50 timed",
      "block": "trigger-1",
      "call": "metrics",
      "retry_ms": 3000,
      "expect": {
        "summary.hotkey_to_first_frame.count": {
          "ge": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "trigger 1/50 hides",
      "block": "trigger-1",
      "call": "trigger_hotkey",
      "args": {
        "action": "capture"
      },
      "expect": {
        "route": null,
        "shell.visible": false
      }
    },
